url: "https://github.com/tue-bmd/multiphysics-ultrasound-models/tree/main/studies/01-vascular-network-coupling"
abstract: >-
  A v0 simulation study of vascular-network flow, intravascular tracer
  transport, and vascular-compliance relaxation under compression. Paired
  perturbations test whether mechanical and transport observables depend on the
  same vascular organization.
